# A team: the lead and the agents it starts, in panes of the workspace.
title lmux team
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
pre rm -rf .devcontainer
run lmux team . --nested
wait 8
chapter Teams
caption lmux team ~/src/acme-api | the lead opens its agents in the workspace
frame 2
type Start two agents in parallel: one describes internal/gateway in five lines, the other describes the README in five lines. Neither changes a file.
enter
wait 20
frame 3
film 3 1.4
caption Alt+[ | the rail, with a row per agent and what it has spent
keys M-[
wait 1.5
frame 3
caption r | what an agent is writing, read from its own transcript
keys Down
wait 0.5
keys Down
wait 0.5
keys Down
wait 0.8
keys r
wait 3.5
frame 4
keys q
wait 1.4
frame 2
